# Rockafellar, Part IV: Representation and Inequalities

This module collects §§17–22 of [rockafellar1970convex], which the book prints as Part IV:
Carathéodory's theorem, extreme points and faces, polyhedral convex sets and functions and their
applications, Helly's theorem and systems of convex inequalities, and linear inequalities. 65 of the
70 numbered results of Part IV are formalized; the five that are not are in §22.

